meta {
  name: Billing
  seq: 7
}

docs {
  Billing exceptions. Reading needs `billing.view`; credits need `billing.grant-credits`;
  plan time needs `billing.extend-plan`; refunds need `billing.refund` (owner, finance).
  Money-moving requests need a reason and a fresh code, are rate limited, and are safe
  to retry: send an `Idempotency-Key` header and a repeat replays the first answer.
}
